Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Antisamy Hook|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Antisamy Hook|
		|pageName|Antisamy Test Page|
		|portletName|Wiki|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Page add
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	Then Portlet add PG
		|portletName|${portletName}|
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Wiki Front Page Content Javascript
Priority: 4
	Given these variables
		|wikiPageContent||
	When these variables
		|wikiPageText|PASS|
	Then WikiPage add Front Page PG
		|htmlSource|true|
		|pageName|${pageName}|
		|wikiPageContent|${wikiPageContent}|
		|wikiPageText|${wikiPageText}|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Page add
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	Then Portlet add PG
		|portletName|${portletName}|

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Wiki Front Page Content Javascript
Priority: 4
	Given these variables
		|wikiPageContent||
	When these variables
		|wikiPageText|PASS|
	Then WikiPage add Front Page PG
		|htmlSource|true|
		|pageName|${pageName}|
		|wikiPageContent|${wikiPageContent}|
		|wikiPageText|${wikiPageText}|